1. Install node version 18 or 20.
2. Open a new terminal.
3. Run "npm install".
4. Run "npm run lint" for linting.
5. Run "npm test" to run tests.
6. Run "node server.js" to start the server on port 5000.

Note - Start backend before frontend.
       For frontend clone the repo and run the code using the steps in the README file.